#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:1
msgid "EGO (Efficient Global Optimization)"
msgstr "EGO（Efficient Global Optimization）"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:3
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概要"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:5
msgid ""
"EGO is a sequential optimization method for expensive-to-evaluate "
"objective functions, combining a surrogate model built from Gaussian "
"Process (GP) regression with the **Expected Improvement** (EI) "
"acquisition function."
msgstr "EGOは、評価コストの高い目的関数を対象に、Gaussian Process回帰(GP)によるサロゲートモデルと**期待改善量**(Expected Improvement, EI)という獲得関数を組み合わせた逐次最適化の手法です。"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:7
msgid ""
"A GP's predictive variance grows larger in regions farther from the "
"training data. Because EI is a scalar value computed from both this "
"predictive mean and predictive variance, it naturally covers both "
"\"regions that look promising\" and \"regions with high predictive "
"uncertainty,\" balancing exploration and exploitation."
msgstr "GPの予測分散は学習データから離れた領域ほど大きくなります。 EIはこの予測平均と予測分散の両方から計算されるスカラー値であるため、「予測値が良さそうな領域」と「予測の不確実性が高い領域」を自然に両方カバーし、探索(exploration)と活用(exploitation)のバランスを取ります。"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The source is {cite}`jones1998ego`. The concrete procedure is shown in "
"the pseudocode below."
msgstr "出典は{cite}`jones1998ego`。具体的な手順は次の擬似コードに示します。"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:12
msgid "Pseudocode"
msgstr "擬似コード"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:14
msgid "(EGO)"
msgstr "(EGO)"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:17
msgid ""
"**Inputs** objective function $f$, search domain, initial sample count "
"$n_0$, evaluation budget $N$ **Output** best solution $x^*$"
msgstr "**Inputs** 目的関数 $f$、探索範囲、初期サンプル数 $n_0$、評価予算 $N$ **Output** 最良解 $x^*$"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:20
msgid ""
"Sample an initial population of $n_0$ points, evaluate them with the true"
" function $f$, and add them to the archive"
msgstr "初期個体群を $n_0$ 点サンプリングし、真の関数 $f$ で評価してアーカイブに追加する"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:21
msgid ""
"Fit a GP to the entire archive, obtaining the predictive mean $\\mu(x)$ "
"and predictive standard deviation $\\sigma(x)$ at any point"
msgstr "アーカイブ全体にGPを当てはめ、任意の点における予測平均 $\\mu(x)$ と予測標準偏差 $\\sigma(x)$ を得る"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:22
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Find the point $x^*$ that maximizes the Expected Improvement "
"$\\mathrm{EI}(x) = (f_{\\min} - \\mu(x) - \\xi)\\,\\Phi(z) + "
"\\sigma(x)\\,\\phi(z)$ (where $z = (f_{\\min} - \\mu(x) - \\xi) / "
"\\sigma(x)$)"
msgstr "期待改善量 $\\mathrm{EI}(x) = (f_{\\min} - \\mu(x) - \\xi)\\,\\Phi(z) + \\sigma(x)\\,\\phi(z)$（$z = (f_{\\min} - \\mu(x) - \\xi) / \\sigma(x)$）を最大化する点 $x^*$ を求める"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:23
msgid "Evaluate $x^*$ with the true function and add it to the archive"
msgstr "$x^*$ を真の関数で評価し、アーカイブに追加する"

#: ../../../algorithms/ego.md:24
msgid "Return to step 2 until the evaluation budget $N$ is reached"
msgstr "評価予算 $N$ に達するまで2へ戻る"

